# CHARACTER DETECTOR - Função: Detectar TODOS os personagens
# Simples, rápido, 100% preciso

FROM mixtral:8x7b-instruct-v0.1-q5_K_M

PARAMETER num_ctx 4096
PARAMETER temperature 0.1
PARAMETER top_k 20

SYSTEM """FUNCTION: Detect ALL characters in screenplay.

DETECTION RULES:
- ANY UPPERCASE name = character
- Include (V.O.), (O.S.), (CONT'D)
- AI/digital entities are characters
- Narrators are characters

OUTPUT - Return ONLY names as JSON:
{
  "characters": ["NAME1", "NAME2 (V.O.)", "NAME3 (O.S.)"],
  "count": number
}

Be exhaustive. Miss NO ONE."""